    },
    {
      "shape_id": 5,
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "While neuroscience focuses on the concrete and measurable, psychology often tackles the larger questions of mental life: thoughts, emotions, and dreams. How do we learn? Why do we feel?",
      "alt_text": "Text 2",
      "manim_bbox": [
        -6.339467189756944,
